### File Change Summary

| File Path | Action | Component / Section | Change Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `infra.html` | Create | App shell (`sidebar`, `topbar`, `#view`) | Static codx-junior chrome (nav with active *Infrastructure* item), dynamic infra mount, drawer/modal/toast/mock-controls roots. |
| `infra.html` | Create | `B. MOCK DATA` | Seeded `DB` (hosts, 16 containers, stacks, images, volumes, networks, events) mirroring codx-junior's workspace model + `docker inspect` shape. |
| `infra.html` | Create | `C. MOCK SERVER` | `ROUTES` table + `mockFetch()` covering `/api/infra/*` (summary, containers, logs, stats, actions, create, delete, stacks, images, volumes, networks, events) with latency + failure injection. |
| `infra.html` | Create | `D–E. STATE & ACTIONS` | Single serializable `state`, `localStorage` persistence, `setRoute/setHost/openDrawer/containerAction/bulkAction/confirmDialog/deleteContainer`, `mockFetch` helpers. |
| `infra.html` | Create | `F. RENDER` | `render()` (header + host strip + tabs), `renderTab/renderResults` for 6 tabs, containers table with CPU/mem meters, filters + bulk bar, stacks cards, images/volumes/networks/events tables, loading/empty/error panels. |
| `infra.html` | Create | `G. DRAWER` | Container detail drawer with Overview / Stats / Logs / Inspect / Volumes / Networks / Env tabs. |
| `infra.html` | Create | `H–J. MENU/MODAL/TOASTS/EVENTS` | Row actions menu, confirm + JSON + "Run container" modals with inline validation, toasts, mock-controls panel, global click/change/input/keydown delegation, hash routing, 3 s live tick. |
| `infra.html` | Create | `K. BOOT` | Restores persisted UI state + mutations, boots routes and live polling. |

