## 4. File Change Summary

| File Path | Action | Component / Section | Change Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `src/config/apps.js` | Modify | `APPS` registry | Added `infra` app entry (`id: 'infra'`, `component: 'infra'`, `icon: fa-solid fa-server`, `route: () => ({ name: 'infra' })`) in a new *Infrastructure (Docker)* section after `browser-sessions`. |
| `src/config/appComponentsMap.js` | Modify | imports + `APP_COMPONENTS_MAP` | Imported `InfraView` from `../views/infra/InfraView.vue`; mapped `'infra': InfraView` so both dockview panels and `AppRouteView` can render it. |
| `src/router/index.ts` | Modify | `routes` | Added `{ path: '/:projectName/infra', name: 'infra', component: AppRouteView, meta: { app: 'infra' } }` after the `metrics` route (auto-scoped by `withProject()`). |
| `src/components/main-menu/MainMenuItems.vue` | Modify | template | Added `<MenubarItem @click="$ui.openInfra()">` with `fa-solid fa-server` and the label **Infrastructure**, placed after *Analytics*. |
| `src/store/ui.js` | Modify | `actions` | Added `openInfra()` action → `$storex.ui.openApp('infra')` (mirrors `openGitView()`), placed after it. |
| `src/views/infra/InfraView.vue` | Modify | root `<div>` | Added `w-full h-full overflow-auto` so the view scrolls correctly inside a dockview panel / route shell instead of clipping. |

### How it behaves now

| Trigger | Desktop mode (`.../desktop`) | Single / mobile mode |
|---|---|---|
| Menu → **Infrastructure** | Opens a new dockview **panel** (or focuses the existing one — single-instance app) | Pushes `/:projectName/infra` |
| Direct URL `/codx-junior/infra` | Unreachable (desktop route wins) | Renders `InfraView` directly — refresh safe |
| Re-opening from the Window menu / AppBar | Re-focuses the same panel | Re-navigates to the same route |

### Follow-up recommendation

The `/api/infra/*` contract is **admin-gated** on the backend. Once that's enforced, gate the menu entry the same way `Knowledge` is:

```vue
<MenubarItem @click="$ui.openInfra()" v-if="$users.isProjectAdmin">
  <i class="fa-solid fa-server"></i>
  Infrastructure
</MenubarItem>
```

I left it ungated for now so the mock-backed view is reachable for everyone during development.

